r-field/choices "ac108f71-110d-5def-a988-7adf10aad264"] [:db/add "bea41166-803e-5e0b-8045-a5fea638bee2" :answer-field/correct "ac108f71-110d-5def-a988-7adf10aad264"] [:db/ensure "bea41166-803e-5e0b-8045-a5fea638bee2" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811" :question/id #uuid "a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811"] [:db/add "a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 \\cdot 5^{x^{2} + 2} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{5^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{2} + 2$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2 x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 \\cdot 5^{x^{2} + 2} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{5^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5^{x^{2} + 2}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811" :question/answer-fields "bea41166-803e-5e0b-8045-a5fea638bee2"] [:db/ensure "a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions "a4503e29-3b4f-54ed-b64a-d669140a8811"] [:db/add "5c86af66-2876-502b-abc7-d43867fae482" :answer/id #uuid "5c86af66-2876-502b-abc7-d43867fae482"] [:db/add "5c86af66-2876-502b-abc7-d43867fae482" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5c86af66-2876-502b-abc7-d43867fae482" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\frac{5^{x^{3}}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "5c86af66-2876-502b-abc7-d43867fae482" :answer/validate] [:db/add "489cadc9-f65a-56d8-80f7-12a41d63df3e" :answer-field/id #uuid "489cadc9-f65a-56d8-80f7-12a41d63df3e"] [:db/add "489cadc9-f65a-56d8-